<title>USA: MagiNet IPO put off until early next year.</title>
<headline>MagiNet IPO put off until early next year.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Underwriter Lehman brothers said the initial public offering of MagiNet Corp has been temporarily postponed until the beginning of 1997.</p>
<p>MagiNet supplies pay-per-view entertainment and interactive video services, like express checkout and room service, to the hospitality industry outside North America. It had been expected to go public sometime this week.</p>
</text>
